  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDjinni Dataset (English CVs part)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\n The Djinni Recruitment Dataset (English CVs part)  contains 150,000 job descriptions and 230,000 anonymized candidate CVs, posted between 2020-2023 on the Djinni IT job platform. The dataset includes samples in English and Ukrainian.\n The dataset contains various attributes related to candidate CVs, including position titles, candidate information, candidate highlights, job search preferences, job profile types, English… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/lang-uk/recruitment-dataset-candidate-profiles-english.",
